<view class="page"><view class="title">大厨的菜谱</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{r}}"><view class="card"><image wx:if="{{photo}}" src="{{photo}}" style="width:100%;height:400rpx;border-radius:24rpx" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="muted">{{r.imageSource==='user'?'自家照片':r.imageSource==='ai'?'AI 示例图片':'还没有照片'}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}">用自家的照片</button><text class="label">菜名</text><input value="{{r.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="field" maxlength="40" /><text class="label">分类</text><input value="{{r.category}}" data-key="category" bindinput="field" maxlength="20" /><text class="label">这些食材够几份基准食量</text><input type="digit" value="{{r.base}}" data-key="base" bindinput="field" /><view class="muted">默认两份。采购时按两个人的食量系数和做菜次数缩放。</view></view><view class="heading">食材与基准用量</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{r.ingredients}}" wx:key="index"><text class="label">食材名称</text><input value="{{item.name}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="name" bindinput="ingredient" maxlength="40" /><view class="subgrid"><view><text class="label">数量</text><input type="digit" value="{{item.qty}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="qty" bindinput="ingredient" /></view><view><text class="label">单位</text><picker range="{{units}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="unit"><view class="field">{{item.unit}} · 更换</view></picker></view></view><button class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">移除这项食材</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="add">＋ 添一项食材</button><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存菜谱与新分量</button><view class="card"><view class="heading">这次做得怎么样？</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{['够吃','剩多了','不够']}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{result===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="result">{{item}}</button></view><textarea value="{{note}}" bindinput="note" placeholder="记下这次的经验" auto-height maxlength="200" /><button class="secondary" bindtap="feedback" disabled="{{busy}}">记下经验</button><view class="muted">记录不会自动改配方。需要调整时，修改上面的食材数量，再保存。</view><view wx:for="{{feedback}}" wx:key="at" class="divider">{{item.result}} · {{item.note}}</view></view></block></view>